def max_sum_increasing_subseq(arr, n, i, k):
    if k > n - 1 or i < 0 or k <= i:
        return 0
    return max(arr[i] + max_sum_increasing_subseq(arr, n, k-1, k-1), max_sum_increasing_subseq(arr, n, i-1, k))
```

